# Anthropic API key – required for AI-powered weekly menu generation.
# Set this as a repository secret (VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY) in GitHub to
# make the app fully functional when deployed to GitHub Pages.
#
# Kopieer dit bestand naar .env.local en vul je Anthropic API sleutel in.
# Maak een sleutel aan via https://console.anthropic.com/
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here
